; RT42 / PT42 (#738). Handwritten DXF; no Tecnigrafo execution.
; 100: >1,000,000 candidate lines, output empty.
; 101: one host but >1,000,000 dashes, output empty.
; 102: h=0 family is skipped; second family still draws.
; 103: empty region. 104: coincident loop vertices are discarded by kernel.
; 105: same valid remaining line, for comparison.
D = DXF file=input.dxf
; PT42 starts drawing the stored pattern families.
; cambia con #738
; Handle 100: 0 generated shapes.
? generated D:100 -> none
; Handle 101: 0 generated shapes.
? generated D:101 -> none
; Handle 102: 1 generated shapes.
? generated D:102 -> LINE start=0,5 end=10,5
; Handle 103: 0 generated shapes.
? generated D:103 -> none
; Handle 104: 0 generated shapes.
? generated D:104 -> none
; Handle 105: 1 generated shapes.
? generated D:105 -> LINE start=0,5 end=10,5
